<p>
  The form on the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> sends what you type to an application I run at
  <strong>api.tzortzoglou.eu</strong>, on a virtual private server rented in my own name. Your message is stored
  there in a database, and a copy is emailed to me.
</p>

